msgstr "@george2 我說「詳細描述」可是說真的！\\>\\n\\@george2_sigh 那本書裡記載了一大堆的細節。"

msgid "@george2_grr Blueprints, progress shots..."
msgstr "@george2_grr 像是藍圖和製程照片……"

msgid "@george2_sigh Took me forever to edit..."
msgstr "@george2_sigh 讓我編輯到天荒地老……"

msgid "@george3_sad ...the Author's book on the creation of Prophetbot..."
msgstr "@george3_sad ……是神秘作者記述預言機誕生的書……"

msgid "@george3_sigh ...you know...\\.\\. the first robot you met in our world..."
msgstr "@george3_sigh ……你知道……\\.\\.預言機就是你剛來我們世界遇到的第一個機器人……"

msgid "@niko2 Yeah."
msgstr "@niko2 對啊。"

msgid "@george3_worry ...oh...\\.\\. The book was quite detailed, too...."
msgstr "@george3_worry ……喔……\\.\\.而且那本書內容很詳細……"

msgid "@george3_sigh It...\\.\\. would've been useful to your friend, I think..."
msgstr "@george3_sigh 我想……\\.\\.你朋友可能用得上它吧……"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...yeah."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ……是啊。"

msgid "@george4 The Author's book on the creation of Prophetbot!"
msgstr "@george4 神秘作者記述預言機誕生的書！"

msgid "@george4_golly Remember Prophetbot? \\.\\.The first robot you met in our world?"
msgstr "@george4_golly 你記得預言機嗎？\\.\\.就是你在我們世界遇到的第一個機器人。"

msgid "@george4_omg He's a work of art!!!"
msgstr "@george4_omg 他真是個藝術傑作！！！"

msgid "@george4_smile The Author's book was so detailed... \\.\\.really made me appreciate how much work went into him!"
msgstr "@george4_smile 神秘作者的書寫得非常詳盡……\\.\\.讓我真心敬佩製作預言機所投入的心力！"

msgid "@george5_hmm \"The Creation of Prophetbot\", dear.\\>\\n\\@george5_heh It's one of my favorite books by the Author!"
msgstr "@george5_hmm 親愛的，他拿了《預言機的誕生》。\\>\\n\\@george5_heh 那是神秘作者的著作中，我最喜歡的其中一本！"

msgid "@george5_hmm The book contains many detailed blueprints and progress shots."
msgstr "@george5_hmm 書中有很多詳細的藍圖和製程照片。"

msgid "@george5_smile I really enjoyed editing it!"
msgstr "@george5_smile 真的讓我編得非常過癮！"

msgid "@george6_point You remember Prophetbot? \\>\\n\\@george6 The first robot you met in our world?"
msgstr "@george6_point 你記得預言機吧？\\>\\n\\@george6 就是你在我們世界遇到的第一個機器人。"

msgid "@niko ...yeah?"
msgstr "@niko ……應該吧？"

msgid "@george6_smile The Author wrote a book on how he was made!\\>\\n\\@george6_shrug It's one of his best works, bruh."
msgstr "@george6_smile 神秘作者寫了一本關於他製造過程的書！\\>\\n\\@george6_shrug 跟你說，那本真的是他最佳傑作之一。"

msgid "@george6 You just gotta love that guy's attention to detail... all the little parts that just came together..."
msgstr "@george6 真的不得不佩服他那麼深入細節欸……最後會組合在一起的每一個小零件都沒漏掉……"

msgid "@george6_point ...was the freshest book I've ever edited, man!"
msgstr "@george6_point ……老天，那真是我編過最讓人耳目一新的書了！"

