msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Yup... still scared of ladders."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 沒錯……我還是怕爬梯。"

msgid "Y'know, now that everyone's coming to me for help..."
msgstr "你知道嗎，現在大家都來找我幫忙……"

msgid "...it really makes me appreciate you more, messiah!"
msgstr "……真的讓我更欣賞你了，救世主！"

msgid "Thank you for all you've done for us."
msgstr "謝謝你為我們做的一切。"

msgid "Looks like my life's work is finally being put to good use!"
msgstr "看來我畢生心血結晶終於派上用場！"

msgid "As long as we conserve the water we have on hand..."
msgstr "只要我們保留現有的水……"

msgid "...my water pills should be able to keep everyone here from going thirsty for weeks!"
msgstr "……我的水藥片應該可以讓這裡的所有人好幾個 禮拜都不用喝水！"

msgid "@niko A coffee machine."
msgstr "@niko 咖啡機。"

msgid "@niko It's almost empty..."
msgstr "@niko 裡面快要空了……"

msgid "@niko This stand smells... sugary."
msgstr "@niko 這個攤位……有甜甜的香味。"

msgid "Candy skewers, fresh off the grill!"
msgstr "剛剛烤好的烤糖串喔！"

msgid "...Not very nutritious, I'm afraid."
msgstr "……恐怕不太營養。"

msgid "But at least they'll keep the evacuees from gettin' hungry!"
msgstr "可是至少可以讓避難者填飽肚子！"

msgid "@niko A photo of some plants."
msgstr "@niko 某種植物的照片。"

msgid "The city gate was destroyed a while back, I can't go into the Glen anymore..."
msgstr "城市大門不久前被破壞，我無法再進入綠沼澤了……"

msgid "I'm not sure where I'll be able to get my supply of fish, at this rate..."
msgstr "這樣下去，真不知道我的魚要上哪補貨……"

msgid "@niko Some sort of plaque."
msgstr "@niko 某種牌匾。"

msgid "I still have plenty of these soup dumplings left!"
msgstr "我還有剩下很多湯餃！"

msgid "Looks like it should feed everyone here for at least another day."
msgstr "看起來至少還夠這裡的每個人再吃一天。"

msgid "@niko_what2 (This guy scares me, \\p...!)"
msgstr "@niko_what2 （\\p，這個人讓我很害怕……！）"

msgid "..."
msgstr "……"

msgid "....WHAT!? You need something?!"
msgstr "……怎麼！？你需要什麼嗎？！"

msgid "@niko_huh No...?"
msgstr "@niko_huh 沒有……？"

msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr "隨便你。"

msgid "BUT, just so that you know."
msgstr "可是，還是要跟你說。"

msgid "Due to recent events, the restriction on noise levels in the library has been temporarily lifted."
msgstr "因為最近的事件，所以圖書館的噪音管制暫時解除了。"

msgid "...So I WON'T be kicking people out like before."
msgstr "……所以我不會像之前那樣把人趕出去。"

msgid "@niko_what Um..."
msgstr "@niko_what 呃……"

msgid "....WHAT???"
msgstr "……什麼？？？"

msgid "You think I'm gonna be throwing out the evacuees just cuz I'm a delinquent stuck doing community service???"
msgstr "只因為我是個被判社區服務的不良少年，你就覺得我會把這些避難者都趕出去嗎？？？"

msgid "@niko_what ...No...?"
msgstr "@niko_what ……沒有……？"

msgid "Good!!! Because I'm NOT!!!!!"
msgstr "很好！！！因為我不會趕走他們！！！！！"

msgid "Looks like I'll have to cancel my appointment..."
msgstr "看來我得取消我的預約了……"

msgid "This stinks!"
msgstr "討厭！"

msgid "@niko A photo of some people."
msgstr "@niko 一些人的合照。"

msgid "[EVENING NEWS! EVENING NEWS!]"
msgstr "[晚間新聞！晚間新聞！]"

msgid "[EVERYTHING IS TERRIBLE]"
msgstr "[這一切都糟透了]"

msgid "@bookbot [IF YOU HAVE AN INQUIRY. PLEASE APPROACH FROM THE FRONT.]"
msgstr "@bookbot [如果有任何問題，請由前方前進。]"

msgid "@niko I'm good, thanks!"
msgstr "@niko 不用了，謝謝！"

msgid "@kelvin [The world is going to be much colder soon.]"
msgstr "@kelvin [世界很快就會變得非常寒冷。]"

msgid "@kelvin [At least... I can keep everyone here warm.]"
msgstr "@kelvin [至少……我可以讓這裡的所有人保持溫暖。]"

msgid "@niko Looks like a list of book titles written here..."
msgstr "@niko 看起來這裡有書名的清單……"

msgid "ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"
msgstr "ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"

msgid "@niko_speak A big book with a black clover on the cover."
msgstr "@niko_speak 一本大書，封面上有黑苜蓿標誌。"

msgid "@niko The title says \"A Comprehensive Guide to Phosphors\"."
msgstr "@niko 書名是《燐礦完全指南》。"

msgid "@niko A marker drawing of a clover."
msgstr "@niko 用白板筆畫的苜蓿。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed She's asleep..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 她睡著了……"

msgid "*yawn*"
msgstr "*打呵欠*"

msgid "The lab complex got totaled, didn't it...."
msgstr "實驗室大樓全塌毀了，對不對……"

msgid "@niko3 Yeah..."
msgstr "@niko3 是啊……"

msgid "All those hours I put into my work, and now..."
msgstr "我花了那麼多時間投入工作，現在卻……"

msgid "now...."
msgstr "現在……"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed She fell asleep..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 她睡著了……"

msgid "@niko A marker eraser."
msgstr "@niko 白板板擦。"

msgid "@niko The title says \"Emergence of New Ecological Niches In A Post-Sun World\"."
msgstr "@niko 書名是《失去太陽的世界中，新興生態位》。"

msgid "Monitoring... monitoring..."
msgstr "監控中……監控中……"

msgid "Looks like our scouting unit #A27 is still doing okay..."
msgstr "看起來我們的偵查單位#A27還在正常工作……"

msgid "@niko A green marker."
msgstr "@niko 綠色白板筆。"

msgid "kip card"
msgstr "琪普的借書證"

msgid "Robots are the only ones that we can send out there, now..."
msgstr "現在我們能派出的也只有機器人了……"

msgid "Thankfully, we still have a couple of units that aren't too badly damaged..."
msgstr "幸好我們還有幾組損壞不太嚴重的單位……"

msgid "This little guy ran into some squares earlier and managed to escape mostly intact."
msgstr "這個小傢伙之前遇到了方塊，大致上算是全身而退了。"

msgid "These newer models are pretty tough!"
msgstr "這些新型號還滿耐用的！"

msgid "I just like looking at pictures."
msgstr "我只喜歡看圖片。"

msgid "@niko_speak You're going through these pages pretty fast!"
msgstr "@niko_speak 你翻閱的速度好快！"

msgid "Actually, it's mostly pictures!"
msgstr "其實這本大多是圖片！"

msgid "The Author is an artist too, y'know!"
msgstr "你知道嗎，神秘作者也是一位藝術家！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I could tell, yeah..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 嗯，我看得出來……"

msgid "@niko A blue marker."
msgstr "@niko 藍色白板筆。"

msgid "niko card"
msgstr "霓光的卡片"

msgid "@niko A red marker."
msgstr "@niko 紅色白板筆。"

msgid "glittery"
msgstr "閃閃發亮"

msgid "His books are the only things keeping me going in these trying times."
msgstr "在這麼艱難的時候，只有他的書能讓我繼續撐下去。"

msgid "With the world being the way it is now..."
msgstr "以這個世界現在的狀態……"

msgid "I'm just glad The Author was able to write down all this stuff before everything went off the rails."
msgstr "我只慶幸神秘作者能夠在一切變成一團亂之前把這些事全部寫下來。"

msgid "I NEED TO FIND OUT HOW THIS BOOK ENDS..."
msgstr "我一定要知道這本書最後的結尾是什麼……"

msgid "@niko2 Ummm...."
msgstr "@niko2 呃……"

msgid "IF I DIE I WANNA DIE READING!"
msgstr "如果我快死了，我要看書看到死！"

msgid "@niko This dry erase board is made of metal."
msgstr "@niko 這塊乾板擦是用金屬做的。"

msgid "cardquest + desk"
msgstr "尋卡任務+桌子"

